'''Bri-Phrang City''',<ref name="Crash and Burn">''[[The High Republic Adventures: Crash and Burn]]''</ref> also known as '''Bri Phrang City''',<ref name="The High Republic Adventures 8">[[The High Republic Adventures (2023) 8|''The High Republic Adventures'' (2023) 8]]</ref> was a [[city]] on<ref name="The High Republic Adventures 1" /> the [[planet]]<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> [[Eriadu]] that was the site of a [[Galactic Republic]] [[Republic Defense Coalition|Defense Coalition]] outpost known as the [[Arkorayal Cabaret Cantina]].<ref name="The High Republic Adventures 3" /> It was hit by an [[Eriadu system Emergence|Emergence]] after the [[Great Hyperspace Disaster]] which damaged a [[Lava reactor core|geothermal plant]] that provided power to [[Eriadu City]].<ref name="Trials">''[[The High Republic: Trials of the Jedi]]''</ref>

